export anchor FieldManualStyle:
    number: 132
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Field manual
    idea: The dashboard written as a light olive drab field manual, with stencil headings, numbered paragraphs, a boxed WARNING for the overdue tasks, ruled tables with hatched progress bars and figures with numbered captions.
    base: light
    palette:
        paper: #e3e1cc, the page around the manual
        page: #f5f3e6, manual pages, fields and the hatch ground
        oliveDrab: #4b5320, the top band, table heads, the current item and this week bars
        darkOlive: #363c17, the band edge and the bell
        ink: #1f2113, text, 2px rules, hatching and focus
        fadedInk: #4a4c36, captions, times and page numbers
        khaki: #a59f78, dotted leaders, never text
        signalYellow: #f2d24b, the primary button and the focus halo
        onTrack: #36561f, the filled circle
        atRisk: #7d5300, the triangle with a bar
        behind: #9e2a1e, the crossed square, the WARNING label and the stamp
    type:
        Headings use Stencil, Stencil Std, Stencilia, Arial Black, Impact,
        sans-serif. Labels use Arial Narrow, Roboto Condensed, Helvetica Neue
        Condensed, Liberation Sans Narrow, Arial in bold caps tracked 0.06
        to 0.16em. Text uses Century Schoolbook, New Century Schoolbook, TeX
        Gyre Schola, Georgia, serif. The chapter title is 30px stencil,
        strength numbers 40px stencil, paragraph heads 17px narrow caps with
        a stencil number, the greeting 26px serif, body 15px at 1.5, times
        12.5px narrow caps in brackets.
    layout:
        An olive band with a darker 6px bottom edge holds a shield logo, the
        stencil brand with FIELD MANUAL BW 10-31 DAILY SITUATION under it, a
        boxed caps search, a yellow New project button, a square bell and
        the name boxed as OKAFOR, MARA. A 220px CONTENTS box on the left
        lists the nav with chapter numbers 1-1 to 6-1 on dotted leaders,
        Home filled olive, with a tilted red FOR TEAM USE stamp. The page on
        the right opens with CHAPTER 1 SITUATION REPORT over a 4px rule and
        SECTION I 31 OCT 2026. Numbered paragraphs follow. 1-1 Greeting
        gives Good afternoon, Mara. and the date. 1-2 Priority is a boxed
        WARNING with a red label saying 4 tasks are overdue, Clear these
        first. 1-3 Strength is a four cell ruled box of stencil numbers,
        the overdue cell tinted. 1-4 Operations is Table 1-1 with olive
        heads, a serial letter, project, unit, a hatched progress bar with
        percent, tasks, due date in caps and status. 1-5 Activity log lists
        lettered sub paragraphs with bracketed times, beside 1-6 Tempo, a
        boxed Figure 1-1 with hatched bars for last week and solid olive bars
        for this week, axis ticks and bracketed week totals. A ruled foot
        gives BW 10-31 and the page number. Below 980px the contents become
        a grid above the page, the table scrolls inside itself.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 20px between paragraphs, 24px page padding and 32px between side by side paragraphs.
    density: Dense and orderly. Everything sits in numbered paragraphs on one long page.
    corners: Square, always.
    borders: 2px ink boxes, 1px ruled table cells, a 4px rule under the chapter title and a 3px WARNING box.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        Solid 16px symbols with the caps word, a filled circle for ON TRACK,
        a triangle with a bar for AT RISK and a crossed square for BEHIND.
        Hatching marks figures.
    focus: A 3px ink outline offset 2px inside a 5px signal yellow halo.
    tone: Orders and reports, such as Situation report, Strength, Operations, Tempo and Clear these first.
